    title: "Upacara Bendera Senin",
    category: "Fasilitas",
    categorySlug: "fasilitas",
    desc: "Pelaksanaan upacara bendera rutin setiap hari Senin di halaman upacara utama YP2SK untuk menanamkan rasa nasionalisme dan melatih kedisiplinan siswa."
  },
  {
    src: "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuCuaBChlfgILPEa3b-x3RZkuvQIDTrBcOnV9eyv8YOsrUk7d8fpIHlNEhScrku8Vl-tQrA1fneD0VZEjL36NGbnyz9EUvEK0qN8D5RsL6rENcfNEeJqeGl-W2pHd6FcAyR8L3s7_l4Deqdbnei_rMlDMcZ1TgxljSzBDXlxjCqeuTbENdHVj0n8T-HoH-qeKlW1HnrxZwWwKKsVqVwh1ooREwvLTpYxUz-S3Cr-jP8mABataK6ALsWCuQ",
